    "# Data Analytics Foundations\n",
    "\n",
    "## The complete pandas workflow for Data Visualization\n",
    "\n",
    "- [Chapter 5: Getting Started with pandas](https://wesmckinney.com/book/pandas-basics)\n",
    "- [Chapter 7: Data Cleaning and Preparation](https://wesmckinney.com/book/data-cleaning)\n",
    "- [Chapter 8: Data Wrangling](https://wesmckinney.com/book/data-wrangling)\n",
    "- [Chapter 9: Plotting and Visualization](https://wesmckinney.com/book/plotting-and-visualization)\n",
    "- [Chapter 10: Data Aggregation and Group Operations](https://wesmckinney.com/book/data-aggregation)\n",
    "\n",
    "::: {.notes}\n",
    "Apresente o módulo como um fluxo analítico completo. A ordem pedagógica difere da ordem numérica: primeiro compreender, preparar e estruturar; depois analisar e comunicar. Todos os dados são sintéticos. Tempo sugerido: 2 min.\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Chapter 5:** Understand\n",
    "2. **Chapter 7:** Prepare\n",
    "3. **Chapter 8:** Structure\n",
    "\n",
    "**Output:** validated, tidy, analysis-ready data.\n",
    "\n",
    "4. **Chapter 10:** Analyze\n",
    "5. **Chapter 9:** Communicate\n",
    "\n",
    "**Output:** validated summaries and defensible graphics.\n",
    "\n",
    "RAW DATA → INSPECT → CLEAN → COMBINE → RESHAPE → GROUP → SUMMARIZE → VISUALIZE → INTERPRET\n",
    "\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "## Learning objectives\n",
    "\n",
    "By the end of the module, students will be able to:\n",
    "\n",
    "- inspect and select labeled tabular data;\n",
    "- diagnose and document quality problems;\n",
    "- combine and reshape tables safely;\n",
    "- distinguish aggregation from transformation;\n",
    "- validate keys, denominators, and analytical outputs;\n",
    "- choose visual encodings based on a question;\n",
    "- create clear, accessible, and defensible visualizations.\n",
    "\n",
    "::: {.notes}\n",
    "Relacione cada objetivo a uma entrega observável. Tempo: 2 min.\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
